{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2021-03-12 16:11:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ ANNOUNCES NOMINATIONS OF LORI DICKERSON FOUCHÉ AND MIGUEL PATRICIO AS NEW BOARD MEMBERS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS NOMINATED LORI DICKERSON FOUCHÉ AND KRAFT HEINZ CEO MIGUEL PATRICIO TO BE ELECTED AS DIRECTORS AT THE UPCOMING KRAFT HEINZ 2021 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS. THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED THAT GEORGE ZOGHBI WILL NOT SEEK RE-ELECTION AT THE 2021 ANNUAL MEETING. MS. FOUCHÉ HAS BEEN NOMINATED TO FILL MR. ZOGHBI'S VACANCY AND MR. PATRICIO HAS BEEN NOMINATED TO"}